flowchart TB
    User[Пользователь] -->|HTTPS| Frontend[React frontend<br/>nginx]
    Admin[Сотрудник ПВЗ] -->|HTTPS| Frontend

    subgraph Backend[Go backend — модульный монолит]
        direction TB

        subgraph Transport[Transport]
            Router[internal/httpserver<br/>routing, middleware, auth]
            Contract[internal/api<br/>generated OpenAPI contract]
            Handler[internal/httpapi<br/>handlers и DTO mapping]
            Router --> Contract --> Handler
        end

        subgraph Application[Application]
            ItemFlow[Items и analyze flow]
            MatchingFlow[internal/application/matching<br/>worker и materializer]
            ChainFlow[Chains и confirmations]
            DeliveryFlow[Admin delivery flow]
            Supporting[Chat, notifications,<br/>reputation и metrics]
        end

        subgraph Domain[Domain rules]
            MatchingDomain[Matching graph,<br/>cycles и scoring]
            ChainRules[Chain invariants<br/>и participant decisions]
            DeliveryRules[Delivery transitions]
            ReputationRules[Review rules]
        end

        subgraph Infrastructure[Infrastructure]
            Repositories[PostgreSQL repositories<br/>SQL и sqlc]
            MatchingJobs[matching_jobs<br/>lease и retry]
            Outbox[outbox_events<br/>lease, retry, deduplication]
            Broadcaster[PostgreSQL broadcaster<br/>LISTEN / NOTIFY]
            SSEHub[Персональный SSE hub]
            MediaAdapter[MinIO adapter]
            AIAdapters[Ollama и внешние AI adapters]
        end

        Handler --> ItemFlow
        Handler --> MatchingFlow
        Handler --> ChainFlow
        Handler --> DeliveryFlow
        Handler --> Supporting

        ItemFlow --> ChainRules
        MatchingFlow --> MatchingDomain
        ChainFlow --> ChainRules
        DeliveryFlow --> DeliveryRules
        Supporting --> ReputationRules

        ItemFlow --> Repositories
        ItemFlow --> AIAdapters
        ItemFlow --> MediaAdapter
        MatchingFlow --> MatchingJobs
        MatchingFlow --> Repositories
        ChainFlow --> Repositories
        ChainFlow --> Outbox
        DeliveryFlow --> Repositories
        DeliveryFlow --> Outbox
        Supporting --> Repositories

        Outbox --> Broadcaster
        Broadcaster --> SSEHub
    end

    Frontend -->|REST и cookie session| Router
    SSEHub -->|SSE events| Frontend

    Repositories --> PostgreSQL[(PostgreSQL 17<br/>pgvector)]
    MatchingJobs --> PostgreSQL
    Outbox --> PostgreSQL
    Broadcaster <-->|pg_notify| PostgreSQL
    MediaAdapter --> MinIO[(MinIO)]
    AIAdapters --> Ollama[Ollama]
    AIAdapters -.-> ExternalAI[Опциональные внешние AI<br/>GigaChat / OpenRouter]

    MatchingFlow -.->|найденный цикл| ChainFlow
    ChainFlow -.->|PENDING: решения участников| ChainFlow
    ChainFlow -.->|все APPROVED:<br/>items MATCHING → LOCKED| DeliveryFlow
    DeliveryFlow -.->|все RECEIVED:<br/>chain → COMPLETED| ChainFlow
